        "right": "NODE_IS_BACKREF(node) || NODE_IS_CALLED(node)"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_unused_capture_required_before_empty_reset",
      "fine_trace_step": 9,
      "description": "Root cause. When a look-behind subtree is proven to match the empty string, `tune_look_behind()` rewrites that anchor in place with `onig_node_reset_empty(node)`. The rewrite frees the old subtree but does not clear `NODE_CALL_BODY` aliases that `tune_call_node_call()` already bound to nodes inside that subtree."
    },
    {
