      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_call_body_argument_reaches_sink_read",
      "fine_trace_step": 16,
      "description": "ASan crash site. After `quantifiers_memory_node_info()` recurses from the outer `{6}` body's inner `*` quantifier into the `NODE_CALL` and then follows its stale `NODE_CALL_BODY` alias, it re-enters this `switch` with `node` pointing to the freed `BAG_MEMORY` object and reads its type field from reclaimed heap memory."
    },
